  "ruleText": "Fis 503.03 Tagging. The department shall not tag fish for the purpose of prize determination in a fishing tournament.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at chapter headings for Fis 400 and Fis 500) #5016, eff 1-1-91, EXPIRED: 1-1-97\n\nNew. #6478, INTERIM, eff 3-28-97, EXPIRED: 7-26-97\n\nNew. #6917, eff 12-22-98; ss by #8119, eff 1-1-05; ss by #10279, eff 2-28-13; ss by #13532, eff 2-1-23; ss by #13798, eff 11-1-23",
